","source_order":[48,47,902],"order":8917},{"id":"santizhu-e-p055a","title":"《搜神记》记柳荣死后复生并自述见张悌受缚","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-fde15e32ef7e7f578281","label":"《搜神记》","text":"《搜神记》记柳荣死后复生并自述见张悌受缚","evidence":["santizhu-q-7a8416cd6b0d5b9429fe"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0132","role":"病死二日后复活并报告所见；仅作为《搜神记》所载叙述者","evidence":["santizhu-q-7a8416cd6b0d5b9429fe"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0110","role":"柳荣声称所见被缚者；不以此作死亡方式证据","evidence":["santizhu-q-7a8416cd6b0d5b9429fe"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-7a8416cd6b0d5b9429fe"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-7a8416cd6b0d5b9429fe","source_order":[48,552,8],"related_events":[{"event":"santizhu-e-o161c","type":"related","evidence":["santizhu-q-7a8416cd6b0d5b9429fe","santizhu-q-1283bfd4d6765e17b41e"]}],"order":8918},{"id":"zongshi-e-o123","title":"震后御晋军，与张悌俱死","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-ed59f7227c5bb0374ebc","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"震后御晋军，与张悌俱死","evidence":["zongshi-q-bacd8e9bd7a074acc7d6"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0126","role":"御晋军战死者","evidence":["zongshi-q-bacd8e9bd7a074acc7d6"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0110","role":"俱死者","evidence":["zongshi-q-bacd8e9bd7a074acc7d6"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-bacd8e9bd7a074acc7d6"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-bacd8e9bd7a074acc7d6","source_order":[51,135,46],"order":9173}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0110","name":"张悌","evidence":["santizhu-q-2edeccf46068a802049f","santizhu-q-1283bfd4d6765e17b41e","santizhu-q-ecd7e1ee0fc79697a0d8","santizhu-q-63dbb0fc9a075bddc66d","santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb","santizhu-q-4ec1bff7bc9b72c70e67","santizhu-q-8625954cb33d4468d47f","santizhu-q-21e817c85d7c0e0452be","santizhu-q-0a8688dce52fa7427fff","santizhu-q-7ab3aacaf5c4af456f14","santizhu-q-c00e3c5afa2f509fb9fc","santizhu-q-7a8416cd6b0d5b9429fe","panlu-q-9c803300aa82314d1ecc","zongshi-q-bacd8e9bd7a074acc7d6"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"panlu-m-5dc99e7377a88cd74ed2","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及张悌","evidence":["panlu-q-9c803300aa82314d1ecc"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"panlu-q-9c803300aa82314d1ecc","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-868322f07629aeb01c40","layer":"original","quote":"姚信、楼玄、贺邵、张悌、郭逴、薛莹、滕修及族弟喜、抗，或清白忠勤，或姿才卓茂〖6〗；皆社稷之桢干〖7〗，国家之良辅；愿陛下重留神思，访以时务：各尽其忠，拾遗万一","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":70,"end":150},{"id":"santizhu-q-0a8688dce52fa7427fff","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-644eb57c9a126837f3a6","layer":"pei","quote":"遂渡江战，吴军大败。诸葛靓与五六百人退走，使过迎悌","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":549,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":761,"end":786},{"id":"santizhu-q-1283bfd4d6765e17b41e","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-45c0aa4ad8cd7d95dfdc","layer":"original","quote":"浑复斩丞相张悌、丹杨太守沈莹等","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":521,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":44},{"id":"santizhu-q-1b13478b0f5af0ad26fb","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4311ae30072f04acbaa0","layer":"pei","quote":"与讨吴护军张翰、扬州刺史周浚成阵相对。沈莹领丹杨锐卒刀盾五千，号曰‘青巾兵’，前后屡陷坚阵：于是以驰淮南军，三冲不动；退引，乱。薛胜、蒋班，因其乱而乘之，吴军以次土崩，将帅不能止；张乔又出其后：大败吴军于版桥，获悌、震、莹等","attribution":"裴注·干宝《晋纪》","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":548,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":169,"end":281},{"id":"santizhu-q-21e817c85d7c0e0452be","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-644eb57c9a126837f3a6","layer":"pei","quote":"吴之将亡，贤愚所知；非今日也！吾恐蜀兵来至此，众心必骇惧，不可复整。今宜渡江，可用决战力争：若其败丧，则同死社稷，无所复恨；若其克胜，则北敌奔走，兵势万倍，便当乘威南上，逆之中道，不忧不破也。若如子计，恐行散尽；相与坐待敌到，君臣俱降，无复一人死难者：不亦辱乎","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":549,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":629,"end":759},{"id":"santizhu-q-2edeccf46068a802049f","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-0dafd2801f25e863dc33","layer":"original","quote":"八月，以军师张悌为丞相〖13〗，牛渚都督何植为司徒〖14〗。执金吾滕（循）〔修〕为司空","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":475,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43},{"id":"santizhu-q-4ec1bff7bc9b72c70e67","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-644eb57c9a126837f3a6","layer":"pei","quote":"魏伐蜀，吴人问悌曰：‘司马氏得政以来，大难屡作；智力虽丰，而百姓未服也。今又竭其资力，远征巴蜀，兵劳民疲而不知恤，败于不暇，何以能济？昔夫差伐齐，非不克胜；所以危亡，不忧其本也，况彼之争地乎？’悌曰：‘不然！曹操虽功盖中夏，威震四海；崇诈仗术，征伐无已：民畏其威，而不怀其德也。丕、叡承之，系以惨虐；内兴宫室，外惧雄豪；东西驰驱，无岁获安：彼之失民，为日久矣！司马懿父子，自握其柄，累有大功；除其烦苛而布其平惠，为之谋主而救其疾：民心归之，亦已久矣！故淮南三叛，而腹心不扰；曹髦之死，四方不动；摧坚敌如折枯，荡异同如反掌；任贤使能，各尽其心：非智勇兼人，孰能如之？其威武张矣，本根固矣，群情服矣，奸计立矣。今蜀，阉宦专朝，国无政令；而玩戎黩武，民劳卒弊；竞于外利，不修守备。彼强弱不同，智算亦胜；因危而伐，殆其克乎？若其不克，不过无功；终无退北之忧，覆军之虑也","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":549,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":31,"end":411},{"id":"santizhu-q-63dbb0fc9a075bddc66d","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4311ae30072f04acbaa0","layer":"pei","quote":"吴副军师诸葛靓，欲屠之，悌曰：‘敌在前，不宜先事其小；且杀降不祥。’靓曰：‘此等以救兵未至而力少，故且伪降以缓我；非来伏也。因其无战心而尽坑之，可以成三军之气。若舍之而前，必为后患！’悌不从，抚之而进","attribution":"裴注·干宝《晋纪》","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":548,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":68,"end":168},{"id":"santizhu-q-7a8416cd6b0d5b9429fe","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-bd13b56d791a176f2445","layer":"pei","quote":"临海松阳人柳荣，从悌至杨府。荣病死船中，二日；时军已上岸，无有埋之者。忽然大呼，言：‘人缚军师！人缚军师！’声激扬，遂活。人问之，荣曰：‘上天，北斗门下，猝见人缚张悌。意中大愕，不觉大呼，言：“何以缚张军师！”门下人怒荣，叱逐使去。荣便去，怖惧，口余声发扬耳。’其日，悌战死。荣至晋元帝时，犹在。","attribution":"《搜神记》","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":551,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":8,"end":156},{"id":"santizhu-q-7ab3aacaf5c4af456f14","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-644eb57c9a126837f3a6","layer":"pei","quote":"靓自往牵之，谓曰：‘（且夫）天下存亡有大数，岂卿一人所知！如何故自取死为？’悌垂涕曰：‘仲思！今日是我死日也！且我作儿童时，便为卿家丞相所拔；常恐不得其死，负名贤知顾。今以身徇社稷，复何遁邪？莫牵曳之如是！’靓流涕放之","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":549,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":792,"end":901},{"id":"santizhu-q-8625954cb33d4468d47f","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-644eb57c9a126837f3a6","layer":"pei","quote":"晋来伐吴，皓使悌督沈莹、诸葛靓，率众三万渡江逆之","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":549,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":461,"end":485},{"id":"santizhu-q-c00e3c5afa2f509fb9fc","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-644eb57c9a126837f3a6","layer":"pei","quote":"去百余步，已见为晋军所杀","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":549,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":902,"end":914},{"id":"santizhu-q-ecd7e1ee0fc79697a0d8","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4311ae30072f04acbaa0","layer":"pei","quote":"吴丞相、军师张悌，护军孙震，丹杨太守沈莹，帅众三万济江，围成阳都尉张乔于杨荷桥；众才七千，闭栅自守，举白接告降","attribution":"裴注·干宝《晋纪》","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":548,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5564fe5f445521640591","start":12,"end":67},{"id":"zongshi-q-bacd8e9bd7a074acc7d6","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-838933eb0906948787bc","layer":"pei","quote":"震后御晋军，与张悌俱死","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1c9591ac978a693556d2","start":46,"end":57}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
